 \"Performance optimization\"\n\n# Testing\ndhar --task \"test authentication feature\" --requirements \"Complete feature testing\"\n\n# Repeat for next feature\n```\n\n### Phase 6: Production Deployment\n```bash\ndhar --task \"Deploy to production\" --requirements \"All features complete\"\n```\n\n## Key Features\n\n### ✅ Feature-by-Feature Implementation\n- Agents implement ONE feature at a time\n- Automatic dependency checking\n- Progress tracking per feature\n\n### ✅ Approval Workflows  \n- Pal reviews and approves major decisions\n- Agents wait for approvals before proceeding\n- Feedback and recommendations provided\n\n### ✅ Coordination State\n- Real-time feature completion tracking\n- Dependency validation\n- Blocker management\n\n### ✅ Agent Communication\n- Request/response system between agents\n- Structured coordination protocols\n- Progress notifications"
